=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync alpine ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23$
# with busybox ntpd. It does not say which server it follows, so$
# there is no Synced to row; the Clock row is the kernel's word.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [+] NTP                  + in sync$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              busybox ntpd$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  Server               pool.ntp.org$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

